# Claude Code plugin development
# Claude Code writes the type declarations for the running build here each
# time it loads the mod (2.1.287+; older builds wrote them to .claude/types/
# via /plugin-types). The declarations are Anthropic's (all rights reserved)
# and the MCP ones list this machine's tools, so neither belongs in a public repo.
.claude-plugin/types/
.claude/types/
.claude/settings.local.json
